# Maps the @tjakoen scope to GitHub Packages. Auth is NOT set here on purpose.
#
# Put your token in your USER config (~/.npmrc) instead — see README "First time":
#   @tjakoen:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
#   //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=<your-token>
#
# A committed `_authToken=${GITHUB_TOKEN}` line does NOT work as a fallback: when
# GITHUB_TOKEN is unset it resolves empty and OVERRIDES the valid token in ~/.npmrc,
# so every install 401s. CI sets its own auth via the environment instead.
@tjakoen:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
